            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jennifer Mills"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The original recipe was much spicier. Allrecipes changed my original recipe. I used baby portabella mushrooms, more chili powder, more paprika, more garlic, and sweet italian sausage. I also did not use the liquid with canned diced tomatoes, I like my chili thick, not runny.\nThank you for the great reviews!!",
