            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bill"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The recipe was good but I thought it needed more spice. I added several tablespoons of Tabasco Chipolte sauce. I also added canned and rinsed red kidney and white navy beans. I thought it turned out very good. Men at a church wild game feast ate it all, so it must have been good.",
